  "notes": "Entirely business-type hospital; governmental fields null. Used 2025 columns only (2024 comparative ignored; p8 is the 2024 operating expense schedule, not recorded). Transfer from Chase County 254,607 recorded as business_type.transfers_net. Business receipts total is computed (operating revenue + nonoperating revenues excluding interest expense); disbursements total computed (operating expenses + interest expense). Detail revenue: gross patient charges by department with contractual allowances, bad debt provision and charity care as negative lines so they total the printed net patient service revenue 16,340,995. Detail expense: per department Salaries and Wages and Other columns (Other recorded as not itemized; nondepartmental depreciation and insurance categorized by label). Estimated third-party payor settlements categorized as other assets. Statements of Cash Flows reconciliation page (trimmed p5) added by v7 re-trim; no new data. Pages after it renumbered (old p5-7 are now p6-8). Read pages 1-8 of 8."
